35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The management office charges 4,200 yen an hour, and the bill goes to one named tenant.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The full pass took one hundred and two minutes, and the grout was spotted again in eleven days.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The kitchen watch shows nearly all the mess comes from just two or three of us cooking.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The chat logs show our arguments always start with someone reminding another about a task that was never done.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The previous tenants divided rooms permanently, but by year two, two of them barely spoke.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: The previous tenants divided rooms permanently, but by year two, two of them barely spoke.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, one hundred and two minutes at 4,200 yen an hour means a 7,000 yen bill for a single visit.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, that’s the cost for one visit. If we need it weekly, that’s nearly 28,000 yen a month.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, that’s a steep monthly hit. I need to see if the workload justifies that expense before we commit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, the logs show the friction comes from unclear standards, not just who cooks. We need a definition of ""done.""","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, that’s exactly what I feared. The previous tenants’ silence proves that rigid division breeds resentment, not just mess.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we hire them, the bill goes to one person who then collects. I need to know who ends up out of pocket in the meantime.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, that’s a real risk. I’d rather not be the one chasing payments while the cleaner waits.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the collection risk is real, but my data shows the mess is concentrated. Paying for a service that ignores the source seems wasteful.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, but if the mess is concentrated, why should the rest of us subsidize it? I need a system that protects me from that unpredictability.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, I hear you. But the previous tenants’ silence shows that rigid division breeds resentment. We need a system that keeps us talking, not just clean.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, if the mess is concentrated, why should the rest of us subsidize it? I need a system that protects me from that unpredictability.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I agree. But I need to know if the hours drop if we outsource, or if I’m just paying to supervise.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, the firm’s terms say they work around anything left out, so you’d still be tidying beforehand. It doesn’t remove the hours.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, that’s a relief. If I still have to prep, I need a system that guarantees the room is actually clean when I walk in, not just ""worked around.""","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@May, I agree. We need a system that keeps us talking, not just clean.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
